    if ( checkWord ( board , word , index + 1 , row + 1 , col ) or checkWord ( board , word , index + 1 , row - 1 , col ) or checkWord ( board , word , index + 1 , row , col + 1 ) or checkWord ( board , word , index + 1 , row , col - 1 ) ) :
